-# Gnome Bed (v0.3.85)
+# Gnome Bed (v0.3.87)
 
 - One-block red bed with white pillow and oak legs. Uses vanilla Minecraft wool and planks textures.
 - Place facing any cardinal direction; appears in the Syntactic Wizardry creative tab.
@@ -7,3 +7,5 @@
 - Ordinary Gnomes search for unoccupied Gnome Beds at night, walk to bed, lie down, and wake during the day or if threatened.
 - New underground village residence chambers contain four Gnome Beds in place of decorative planks.
 - No effect on Elder spells, workstation claims, or Geomantic Nodes.
+
+- v0.3.87 registration fix: avoid copying `Blocks.RED_BED` state-specific properties. Its state-specific light/behavior lookup requires vanilla BedPart, which the one-block Gnome Bed intentionally lacks. Copy basic properties from `Blocks.RED_WOOL` instead; the Gnome Bed appearance and interaction are unchanged.
